{"id": "97110120", "name": "פולינום מקלורן מסדר 3 של (a+bx)^α – טור בינומי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את פולינום מקלורן מסדר 3 של</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>בעזרת הטור הבינומי.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(P_3(x)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">רשמו פולינום ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">2+x/4-x^2/64+x^3/512</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מוציאים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> מהסוגריים, ומשתמשים בטור הבינומי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((1+u)^{\\alpha}=1+\\alpha u+\\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)}{2!}u^2+\\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)}{3!}u^3+\\dots\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הוצאת גורם</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)=\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)^{ {{CT:3}} }={{CT:1}}^{ {{CT:3}} }\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)^{ {{CT:3}} }={{CT:5}}\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)^{ {{CT:3}} } \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הטור הבינומי</b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha={{CT:3}}\\)</span> המקדמים הם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha={{CT:6}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)}{2}={{CT:7}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\alpha(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)}{6}={{CT:8}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (1+u)^{ {{CT:3}} }\\approx {{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הצבה</b><br>מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:10}}\\)</span> (גם המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:11}}\\)</span> מועלה בחזקה) ומכפילים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P_3(x)={{CT:5}}\\left({{CT:12}}\\right)={{CT:13}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff,taylor,sum,solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צריך להוציא את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> מהסוגריים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((a+bx)^{\\alpha}=a^{\\alpha}\\left(1+\\frac{b}{a}x\\right)^{\\alpha}\\)</span>, ולכן כל הפולינום מוכפל ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a^{\\alpha}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חסר המחובר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^3\\)</span>: פולינום מסדר 3 כולל את החזקות עד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^3\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=\\frac{b}{a}x\\)</span>, ולכן גם המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{b}{a}\\)</span> מועלה בחזקה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u^2=\\frac{b^2}{a^2}x^2\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["A0", "aa", "al", "bb", "c1", "c2", "c3", "f", "ta", "uu", "w1", "w2", "w3"], "nvariants": 50}